<li data-start=3D"1367" data-end=3D"1391" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1369" data-end=3D"1391" class=3D"">Transport (TCP, UDP)</p=
>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1392" data-end=3D"1424" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1394" data-end=3D"1424" class=3D"">Application (HTTP, FTP,=
 DNS)</p>
