rel=3D"noopener" target=3D"_new" class=3D"" href=3D"http://www.google.com/"=
>www.google.com</a>", le DNS traduit ce nom en IP pour acc=C3=A9der au serv=
eur.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"2250" data-end=3D"2312" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
