=99une page web via HTTPS.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"3378" data-end=3D"3420" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3382" data-end=3D"3418">4.2 UDP (User Datagram Protocol)</strong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"3421" data-end=3D"3567">
<li data-start=3D"3421" data-end=3D"3459" class=3D"">
