<p data-start=3D"1893" data-end=3D"2288" class=3D"">1=EF=B8=8F=E2=83=A3 T=
=C3=A9l=C3=A9chargez une image IOS compatible (ex: <strong data-start=3D"19=
39" data-end=3D"1979">c7200-adventerprisek9-mz.124-25d.bin</strong>).<br da=
ta-start=3D"1981" data-end=3D"1984">
2=EF=B8=8F=E2=83=A3 Dans GNS3, allez dans <strong data-start=3D"2010" data-=
end=3D"2057">Edit &gt; Preferences &gt; Dynamips &gt; IOS routers</strong>.=
<br data-start=3D"2058" data-end=3D"2061">
3=EF=B8=8F=E2=83=A3 Cliquez sur <strong data-start=3D"2077" data-end=3D"209=
3">New &gt; Browse</strong>, s=C3=A9lectionnez votre image et cliquez sur <=
strong data-start=3D"2135" data-end=3D"2143">Next</strong>.<br data-start=
=3D"2144" data-end=3D"2147">
