<hr data-start=3D"5983" data-end=3D"5986" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"5988" data-end=3D"6055" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5991" data-end=3D"6053">4. Calcul des sous-r=C3=A9seaux avec le VLSM - Exem=
ple d=C3=A9taill=C3=A9</strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"6057" data-end=3D"6215" class=3D"">Prenons un exemple o=C3=
=B9 nous devons diviser le r=C3=A9seau <code data-start=3D"6109" data-end=
=3D"6122">10.0.0.0/24</code> en plusieurs sous-r=C3=A9seaux en fonction du =
nombre d=E2=80=99h=C3=B4tes n=C3=A9cessaires pour chaque sous-r=C3=A9seau.<=
/p>
<h4 data-start=3D"6217" data-end=3D"6237" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
6222" data-end=3D"6235">Besoins :</strong></h4>
<ul data-start=3D"6238" data-end=3D"6352">
<li data-start=3D"6238" data-end=3D"6266" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6240" data-end=3D"6266" class=3D"">Sous-r=C3=A9seau 1 : 60=
 h=C3=B4tes</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6267" data-end=3D"6295" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6269" data-end=3D"6295" class=3D"">Sous-r=C3=A9seau 2 : 30=
 h=C3=B4tes</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6296" data-end=3D"6324" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6298" data-end=3D"6324" class=3D"">Sous-r=C3=A9seau 3 : 10=
 h=C3=B4tes</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6325" data-end=3D"6352" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6327" data-end=3D"6352" class=3D"">Sous-r=C3=A9seau 4 : 2 =
h=C3=B4tes</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 data-start=3D"6354" data-end=3D"6375" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
6359" data-end=3D"6373">Solution :</strong></h4>
<ul data-start=3D"6376" data-end=3D"6805">
<li data-start=3D"6376" data-end=3D"6483" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6378" data-end=3D"6483" class=3D"">Sous-r=C3=A9seau 1 : Un=
 sous-r=C3=A9seau de 60 h=C3=B4tes n=C3=A9cessite un masque de <code data-s=
tart=3D"6444" data-end=3D"6449">/26</code> (puisque <code data-start=3D"645=
9" data-end=3D"6473">2^6 - 2 =3D 62</code> h=C3=B4tes).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6484" data-end=3D"6591" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6486" data-end=3D"6591" class=3D"">Sous-r=C3=A9seau 2 : Un=
 sous-r=C3=A9seau de 30 h=C3=B4tes n=C3=A9cessite un masque de <code data-s=
tart=3D"6552" data-end=3D"6557">/27</code> (puisque <code data-start=3D"656=
7" data-end=3D"6581">2^5 - 2 =3D 30</code> h=C3=B4tes).</p>
</li>
