<h2 data-start=3D"3213" data-end=3D"3254" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3216" data-end=3D"3254">5. Attribution des Ports aux VLANs</strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"3256" data-end=3D"3387" class=3D"">Une fois que vous avez =
