<h2 data-start=3D"5279" data-end=3D"5330" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5282" data-end=3D"5330">6. Le Protocole VTP (VLAN Trunking Protocol)</stron=
g></h2>
<p data-start=3D"5332" data-end=3D"5475" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
332" data-end=3D"5339">VTP</strong> est un protocole propri=C3=A9taire Cisc=
o permettant la gestion centralis=C3=A9e des VLANs. Il synchronise les VLAN=
s entre plusieurs commutateurs.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"5477" data-end=3D"5498" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5481" data-end=3D"5498">6.1 Modes VTP</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"5499" data-end=3D"5553" class=3D"">Un commutateur peut fon=
ctionner dans trois modes VTP :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5554" data-end=3D"5885">
<li data-start=3D"5554" data-end=3D"5659" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5556" data-end=3D"5659" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
556" data-end=3D"5567">Serveur</strong> (Server) : Permet d=E2=80=99ajouter=
, modifier et supprimer des VLANs sur l=E2=80=99ensemble du domaine VTP.</p=
>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5660" data-end=3D"5756" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5662" data-end=3D"5756" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
662" data-end=3D"5672">Client</strong> (Client) : Re=C3=A7oit et applique l=
es mises =C3=A0 jour des VLANs sans pouvoir les modifier.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5757" data-end=3D"5885" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5759" data-end=3D"5885" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
759" data-end=3D"5774">Transparent</strong> (Transparent) : Ne synchronise =
pas les VLANs avec les autres commutateurs mais permet leur gestion localem=
ent.</p>
</li>
</ul>
