<p data-start=3D"1590" data-end=3D"1637" class=3D"">Le routage repose sur p=
lusieurs concepts cl=C3=A9s :</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"1639" data-end=3D"1668" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
1643" data-end=3D"1668">3.1. Table de Routage</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"1669" data-end=3D"1821" class=3D"">Un routeur utilise une =
<strong data-start=3D"1692" data-end=3D"1712">table de routage</strong> pou=
r stocker les informations sur les r=C3=A9seaux qu'il conna=C3=AEt et comme=
nt les atteindre. Cette table contient :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1822" data-end=3D"1972">
<li data-start=3D"1822" data-end=3D"1854" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1824" data-end=3D"1854" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
