<h3 data-start=3D"2066" data-end=3D"2099" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
2070" data-end=3D"2099">3.2. Processus de Routage</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"2100" data-end=3D"2140" class=3D"">Lorsqu'un paquet arrive=
 sur un routeur :</p>
<ol data-start=3D"2141" data-end=3D"2498">
<li data-start=3D"2141" data-end=3D"2205" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2144" data-end=3D"2205" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
144" data-end=3D"2205">Le routeur examine l=E2=80=99adresse IP de destinati=
on du paquet.</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2206" data-end=3D"2280" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2209" data-end=3D"2280" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
209" data-end=3D"2244">Il consulte sa table de routage</strong> pour d=C3=
=A9terminer le meilleur chemin.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2281" data-end=3D"2386" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2284" data-end=3D"2386" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
284" data-end=3D"2334">Il envoie le paquet =C3=A0 la passerelle appropri=C3=
=A9e</strong> (next-hop) ou directement au r=C3=A9seau de destination.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2387" data-end=3D"2498" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2390" data-end=3D"2498" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
390" data-end=3D"2448">Le processus se r=C3=A9p=C3=A8te sur les routeurs in=
term=C3=A9diaires</strong> jusqu'=C3=A0 ce que le paquet atteigne sa destin=
ation.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"2500" data-end=3D"2503" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"2505" data-end=3D"2531" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
2508" data-end=3D"2531">4. Types de Routage</strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"2533" data-end=3D"2582" class=3D"">Il existe <strong data-=
start=3D"2543" data-end=3D"2569">trois types de routage</strong> principaux=
 :</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"2584" data-end=3D"2625" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
2588" data-end=3D"2625">4.1. Routage Directement Connect=C3=A9</strong></h3=
>
<ul data-start=3D"2626" data-end=3D"2799">
<li data-start=3D"2626" data-end=3D"2714" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2628" data-end=3D"2714" class=3D"">Un routeur conna=C3=AEt=
 automatiquement les r=C3=A9seaux connect=C3=A9s directement =C3=A0 ses int=
erfaces.</p>
</li>
