<h3 data-start=3D"3350" data-end=3D"3380" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3354" data-end=3D"3380">4.3. Routage Dynamique</strong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"3381" data-end=3D"3631">
<li data-start=3D"3381" data-end=3D"3477" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3383" data-end=3D"3477" class=3D"">Le routeur apprend auto=
matiquement les routes gr=C3=A2ce =C3=A0 des <strong data-start=3D"3441" da=
ta-end=3D"3476">protocoles de routage dynamique</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3478" data-end=3D"3555" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3480" data-end=3D"3555" class=3D"">Il ajuste automatiqueme=
nt les routes en fonction des changements du r=C3=A9seau.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3556" data-end=3D"3631" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3558" data-end=3D"3631" class=3D"">Utilis=C3=A9 dans les <=
strong data-start=3D"3575" data-end=3D"3593">grands r=C3=A9seaux</strong> e=
t dans les environnements =C3=A9volutifs.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"3633" data-end=3D"3678" class=3D"">Exemples de protocoles =
de routage dynamique :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3679" data-end=3D"3850">
<li data-start=3D"3679" data-end=3D"3719" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3681" data-end=3D"3719" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
681" data-end=3D"3719">RIP (Routing Information Protocol)</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3720" data-end=3D"3757" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3722" data-end=3D"3757" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
722" data-end=3D"3757">OSPF (Open Shortest Path First)</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3758" data-end=3D"3814" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3760" data-end=3D"3814" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
760" data-end=3D"3814">EIGRP (Enhanced Interior Gateway Routing Protocol)</=
strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3815" data-end=3D"3850" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3817" data-end=3D"3850" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
817" data-end=3D"3850">BGP (Border Gateway Protocol)</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"3852" data-end=3D"3855" class=3D"">
