<h2 data-start=3D"3689" data-end=3D"3749" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3692" data-end=3D"3749">4. EIGRP (Enhanced Interior Gateway Routing Protoco=
l)</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"3750" data-end=3D"3784" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3754" data-end=3D"3784">4.1. Pr=C3=A9sentation de EIGRP</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"3785" data-end=3D"4052" class=3D"">EIGRP est un protocole =
propri=C3=A9taire de Cisco qui combine les avantages des protocoles =C3=A0 =
vecteur de distance et des protocoles =C3=A0 =C3=A9tat de lien. Il utilise =
un algorithme avanc=C3=A9 appel=C3=A9 <strong data-start=3D"3966" data-end=
=3D"4003">DUAL (Diffusing Update Algorithm)</strong> pour assurer une conve=
rgence rapide et efficace.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"4054" data-end=3D"4092" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4058" data-end=3D"4092">4.2. Caract=C3=A9ristiques de EIGRP</strong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"4093" data-end=3D"4373">
<li data-start=3D"4093" data-end=3D"4152" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4095" data-end=3D"4152" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
095" data-end=3D"4122">Distance administrative</strong> : 90 (interne), 170=
 (externe)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4153" data-end=3D"4234" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4155" data-end=3D"4234" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
155" data-end=3D"4167">M=C3=A9trique</strong> : Bas=C3=A9e sur la bande pas=
sante, le d=C3=A9lai, la charge et la fiabilit=C3=A9</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4235" data-end=3D"4299" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4237" data-end=3D"4299" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
237" data-end=3D"4258">Type de protocole</strong> : Hybride (vecteur de dis=
tance am=C3=A9lior=C3=A9)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4300" data-end=3D"4373" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4302" data-end=3D"4373" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
302" data-end=3D"4318">Mises =C3=A0 jour</strong> : Envoi d=E2=80=99informa=
tions uniquement en cas de changement</p>
</li>
</ul>
