<li data-start=3D"3173" data-end=3D"3225" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3175" data-end=3D"3225" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
175" data-end=3D"3200">Encapsulation <code data-start=3D"3191" data-end=3D"=
3198">dot1Q</code></strong> : Identifie chaque VLAN.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3226" data-end=3D"3286" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3228" data-end=3D"3286" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
228" data-end=3D"3286">Les sous-interfaces permettent le routage entre VLAN=
s.</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 data-start=3D"3288" data-end=3D"3308" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3293" data-end=3D"3308">Avantages :</strong></h4>
<p data-start=3D"3309" data-end=3D"3383" class=3D"">=E2=9C=85 Utilise une s=
eule interface du routeur.<br data-start=3D"3350" data-end=3D"3353">
=E2=9C=85 Moins co=C3=BBteux en mat=C3=A9riel.</p>
<h4 data-start=3D"3385" data-end=3D"3409" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3390" data-end=3D"3409">Inconv=C3=A9nients :</strong></h4>
<p data-start=3D"3410" data-end=3D"3477" class=3D"">=E2=9D=8C Charge import=
ante sur l=E2=80=99interface unique en cas de gros trafic.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"3479" data-end=3D"3482" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"3484" data-end=3D"3573" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3487" data-end=3D"3573">4. M=C3=A9thode 3 : Routage Inter-VLAN avec un Comm=
utateur de Niveau 3 (Layer 3 Switch)</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"3574" data-end=3D"3595" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3578" data-end=3D"3595">4.1. Principe</strong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"3596" data-end=3D"3800">
<li data-start=3D"3596" data-end=3D"3666" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3598" data-end=3D"3666" class=3D"">Un <strong data-start=
=3D"3601" data-end=3D"3638">commutateur de niveau 3 (Layer 3)</strong> peut=
 agir comme un routeur.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3667" data-end=3D"3763" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3669" data-end=3D"3763" class=3D"">Il utilise des <strong =
data-start=3D"3684" data-end=3D"3738">interfaces VLANs (SVI - Switch Virtua=
l Interfaces)</strong> pour assurer le routage.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3764" data-end=3D"3800" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3766" data-end=3D"3800" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
766" data-end=3D"3800">Pas besoin de routeur externe.</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"3802" data-end=3D"3824" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3806" data-end=3D"3824">4.2. Topologie</strong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"3825" data-end=3D"3944">
<li data-start=3D"3825" data-end=3D"3856" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3827" data-end=3D"3856" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
827" data-end=3D"3856">VLAN 10 (192.168.10.0/24)</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3857" data-end=3D"3888" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3859" data-end=3D"3888" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
859" data-end=3D"3888">VLAN 20 (192.168.20.0/24)</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3889" data-end=3D"3944" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3891" data-end=3D"3944" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
891" data-end=3D"3918">Commutateur de niveau 3</strong> (routage interne ac=
tiv=C3=A9).</p>
</li>
</ul>
