<h4 data-start=3D"3357" data-end=3D"3384" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3362" data-end=3D"3384">Ce que cela fait :</strong></h4>
<ul data-start=3D"3385" data-end=3D"3541">
<li data-start=3D"3385" data-end=3D"3482" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3387" data-end=3D"3482" class=3D"">Envoie des paquets ICMP=
 (Echo Request) =C3=A0 l'adresse IP cible et attend une r=C3=A9ponse (Echo =
Reply).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3483" data-end=3D"3541" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3485" data-end=3D"3541" class=3D"">Si une r=C3=A9ponse est=
 re=C3=A7ue, la connectivit=C3=A9 est confirm=C3=A9e.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 data-start=3D"3543" data-end=3D"3573" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3548" data-end=3D"3573">R=C3=A9sultats possibles :</strong></h4>
<ul data-start=3D"3574" data-end=3D"3838">
<li data-start=3D"3574" data-end=3D"3669" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3576" data-end=3D"3669" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
576" data-end=3D"3595">R=C3=A9ponse r=C3=A9ussie</strong> : Cela signifie q=
u'il existe une connectivit=C3=A9 entre les deux dispositifs.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3670" data-end=3D"3838" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3672" data-end=3D"3838" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
672" data-end=3D"3691">R=C3=A9ponse =C3=A9chou=C3=A9e</strong> : Si le ping=
 =C3=A9choue, cela peut signifier un probl=C3=A8me avec l'interface r=C3=A9=
seau, une mauvaise configuration d'adresse IP, ou un probl=C3=A8me de pare-=
feu.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"3840" data-end=3D"3843" class=3D"">
<h3 data-start=3D"3845" data-end=3D"3885" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3849" data-end=3D"3885">3.2. <code data-start=3D"3856" data-end=3D"3868">tr=
aceroute</code> (ou <code data-start=3D"3873" data-end=3D"3882">tracert</co=
de>)</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"3886" data-end=3D"4084" class=3D"">La commande <strong dat=
a-start=3D"3898" data-end=3D"3912">traceroute</strong> est utilis=C3=A9e po=
ur identifier le chemin que suivent les paquets pour atteindre leur destina=
tion. Cela peut =C3=AAtre utile pour localiser un point de d=C3=A9faillance=
 dans le r=C3=A9seau.</p>
