<h3 data-start=3D"7006" data-end=3D"7052" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
7010" data-end=3D"7052">4.4. V=C3=A9rification des ACLs et Pare-feu</strong=
></h3>
<p data-start=3D"7053" data-end=3D"7240" class=3D"">Si des <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"7060" data-end=3D"7084">Access Control Lists</strong> (ACLs) sont en =
place, elles peuvent bloquer certains types de trafic. V=C3=A9rifiez si des=
 ACLs appliqu=C3=A9es sur les interfaces peuvent interf=C3=A9rer avec le tr=
afic.</p>
<ul data-start=3D"7241" data-end=3D"7321">
<li data-start=3D"7241" data-end=3D"7321" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7243" data-end=3D"7321" class=3D"">Utilisez la commande <s=
trong data-start=3D"7264" data-end=3D"7285">show access-lists</strong> pour=
 afficher les ACLs configur=C3=A9es.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"7323" data-end=3D"7369" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
7327" data-end=3D"7369">4.5. V=C3=A9rification des Probl=C3=A8mes de NAT</s=
trong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"7370" data-end=3D"7496" class=3D"">Si le probl=C3=A8me con=
cerne l'acc=C3=A8s =C3=A0 Internet, il peut =C3=AAtre d=C3=BB =C3=A0 une ma=
uvaise configuration de NAT (Network Address Translation).</p>
<ul data-start=3D"7497" data-end=3D"7580">
<li data-start=3D"7497" data-end=3D"7580" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7499" data-end=3D"7580" class=3D"">Utilisez <strong data-s=
tart=3D"7508" data-end=3D"7536">show ip nat translations</strong> pour v=C3=
=A9rifier les traductions NAT en cours.</p>
</li>
</ul>
