<h3 data-start=3D"7647" data-end=3D"7698" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
7651" data-end=3D"7698">4.6. V=C3=A9rification des Protocoles de Routage</s=
trong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"7699" data-end=3D"7854" class=3D"">Si le routage dynamique=
 est utilis=C3=A9 (par exemple, <strong data-start=3D"7749" data-end=3D"775=
6">RIP</strong>, <strong data-start=3D"7758" data-end=3D"7766">OSPF</strong=
>, <strong data-start=3D"7768" data-end=3D"7777">EIGRP</strong>), il est im=
portant de v=C3=A9rifier que ces protocoles fonctionnent correctement.</p>
<ul data-start=3D"7855" data-end=3D"7983">
<li data-start=3D"7855" data-end=3D"7983" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7857" data-end=3D"7983" class=3D"">Utilisez la commande <s=
trong data-start=3D"7878" data-end=3D"7899">show ip protocols</strong> pour=
 v=C3=A9rifier que les protocoles de routage sont actifs et configur=C3=A9s=
 correctement.</p>
</li>
</ul>
