<h2 data-start=3D"601" data-end=3D"655" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"60=
4" data-end=3D"655">1. Introduction =C3=A0 l'Analyse de l'=C3=89tat du R=C3=
=A9seau</strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"657" data-end=3D"856" class=3D"">L'analyse de l'=C3=A9tat =
du r=C3=A9seau consiste =C3=A0 examiner diff=C3=A9rents aspects du r=C3=A9s=
eau afin de s'assurer que tous les dispositifs fonctionnent correctement et=
 que la communication est fluide. Cela implique :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"857" data-end=3D"1177">
<li data-start=3D"857" data-end=3D"931" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"859" data-end=3D"931" class=3D"">La surveillance des p=C3=
=A9riph=C3=A9riques r=C3=A9seau (routeurs, commutateurs, etc.).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"932" data-end=3D"1005" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"934" data-end=3D"1005" class=3D"">La v=C3=A9rification des=
 performances du r=C3=A9seau (latence, perte de paquets).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1006" data-end=3D"1079" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1008" data-end=3D"1079" class=3D"">La validation de la con=
figuration du r=C3=A9seau (adresses IP, VLANs, etc.).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1080" data-end=3D"1177" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1082" data-end=3D"1177" class=3D"">L=E2=80=99identificatio=
n des probl=C3=A8mes de connectivit=C3=A9 ou de performance avant qu=E2=80=
=99ils ne se produisent.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"1179" data-end=3D"1331" class=3D"">Un diagnostic efficace =
peut permettre de r=C3=A9soudre les probl=C3=A8mes de mani=C3=A8re proactiv=
e et d'=C3=A9viter des pannes ou des interruptions de service importantes.<=
/p>
