<p data-start=3D"3789" data-end=3D"3906" class=3D"">Les interfaces utilisan=
t des sous-r=C3=A9seaux VLSM appara=C3=AEtront dans les bases de donn=C3=A9=
es OSPF. Pour v=C3=A9rifier, utilisez :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3907" data-end=3D"3998">
<li data-start=3D"3907" data-end=3D"3998" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3909" data-end=3D"3998" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"390=
9" data-end=3D"3923">show ip ospf</code> et <code data-start=3D"3927" data-=
end=3D"3950">show ip ospf database</code> pour observer les r=C3=A9seaux et=
 sous-r=C3=A9seaux OSPF.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"4000" data-end=3D"4003" class=3D"">
