8" data-end=3D"7233">show ip route</code> : Affiche les routes redistribu=
=C3=A9es.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7270" data-end=3D"7371" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7272" data-end=3D"7371" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"727=
2" data-end=3D"7291">show ip protocols</code> : Affiche les protocoles de r=
outage actifs et les param=C3=A8tres de redistribution.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7372" data-end=3D"7475" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7374" data-end=3D"7475" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"737=
4" data-end=3D"7397">show ip ospf database</code> et <code data-start=3D"74=
01" data-end=3D"7425">show ip eigrp topology</code> : Pour v=C3=A9rifier la=
 base de donn=C3=A9es OSPF ou EIGRP.</p>
</li>
</ul>
