o</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"4997" data-end=3D"5034" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5001" data-end=3D"5034">3.1. QoS sur un Routeur Cisco</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"5035" data-end=3D"5269" class=3D"">Les <strong data-start=
=3D"5039" data-end=3D"5057">routeurs Cisco</strong> sont souvent responsabl=
