</li>
<li data-start=3D"3114" data-end=3D"3304" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3116" data-end=3D"3304" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
116" data-end=3D"3164">V=C3=A9rifier les adresses IP et les sous-r=C3=A9sea=
ux</strong> : Assurez-vous que les adresses IP des sites distants sont corr=
ectement configur=C3=A9es. V=C3=A9rifiez =C3=A9galement que le NAT ne cr=C3=
=A9e pas de conflits.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3306" data-end=3D"3512" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3308" data-end=3D"3475" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
308" data-end=3D"3329">V=C3=A9rifier les ACLs</strong> : Les Access Control=
