silience</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"6578" data-end=3D"6660" class=3D"">Les VLANs peuvent =C3=
=A9galement =C3=AAtre utilis=C3=A9s pour am=C3=A9liorer la r=C3=A9silience =
