<li data-start=3D"3375" data-end=3D"3450" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3377" data-end=3D"3450" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
377" data-end=3D"3399">Areas non-backbone</strong> : Les autres areas qui s=
ont connect=C3=A9es =C3=A0 l'area 0.</p>
</li>
</ul>
