<p data-start=3D"2007" data-end=3D"2066" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
007" data-end=3D"2028">S=C3=A9curit=C3=A9 r=C3=A9seau :</strong> VPN, IPSec=
, ACL, pare-feu, Cisco ISE.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2067" data-end=3D"2146" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2069" data-end=3D"2146" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
069" data-end=3D"2099">Qualit=C3=A9 de service (QoS) :</strong> Mise en =C5=
=93uvre et d=C3=A9pannage des strat=C3=A9gies QoS.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2147" data-end=3D"2218" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2149" data-end=3D"2218" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
149" data-end=3D"2195">Gestion des performances et surveillance :</strong> =
SNMP, NetFlow, Syslog.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"2220" data-end=3D"2223" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"2225" data-end=3D"2260" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
2228" data-end=3D"2260">2. M=C3=A9thodologie de D=C3=A9pannage</strong></h2=
>
<h3 data-start=3D"2262" data-end=3D"2304" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
2266" data-end=3D"2304">2.1. Collecte de Donn=C3=A9es Initiales</strong></h=
3>
<p data-start=3D"2306" data-end=3D"2457" class=3D"">Le d=C3=A9pannage comme=
nce toujours par la collecte d'informations. Il est essentiel de comprendre=
 le contexte du probl=C3=A8me avant de commencer le diagnostic.</p>
<ol data-start=3D"2459" data-end=3D"3091">
<li data-start=3D"2459" data-end=3D"2721" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2462" data-end=3D"2517" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
462" data-end=3D"2517">Interroger les utilisateurs ou les =C3=A9quipes r=C3=
=A9seau :</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"2521" data-end=3D"2721">
<li data-start=3D"2521" data-end=3D"2556" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2523" data-end=3D"2556" class=3D"">Quels sont les sympt=C3=
=B4mes exacts ?</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2560" data-end=3D"2624" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2562" data-end=3D"2624" class=3D"">Quelle est l'=C3=A9tend=
ue du probl=C3=A8me ? Est-ce localis=C3=A9 ou global ?</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2628" data-end=3D"2665" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2630" data-end=3D"2665" class=3D"">Quand le probl=C3=A8me =
a-t-il commenc=C3=A9 ?</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2669" data-end=3D"2721" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2671" data-end=3D"2721" class=3D"">Quel mat=C3=A9riel ou q=
uelle application est affect=C3=A9e ?</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2723" data-end=3D"2931" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2726" data-end=3D"2773" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
726" data-end=3D"2773">Analyser les logs syst=C3=A8mes et les alertes :</st=
rong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"2777" data-end=3D"2931">
<li data-start=3D"2777" data-end=3D"2851" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2779" data-end=3D"2851" class=3D"">Examiner les logs des =
=C3=A9quipements r=C3=A9seau (routeurs, switches, serveurs).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2855" data-end=3D"2931" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2857" data-end=3D"2931" class=3D"">Rechercher des erreurs,=
 des messages d'alerte ou des probl=C3=A8mes r=C3=A9currents.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2933" data-end=3D"3091" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2936" data-end=3D"2973" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
936" data-end=3D"2973">V=C3=A9rifier l=E2=80=99=C3=A9tat des =C3=A9quipemen=
ts :</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"2977" data-end=3D"3091">
<li data-start=3D"2977" data-end=3D"3033" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2979" data-end=3D"3033" class=3D"">V=C3=A9rifier si les =
=C3=A9quipements sont allum=C3=A9s et connect=C3=A9s.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3037" data-end=3D"3091" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3039" data-end=3D"3091" class=3D"">V=C3=A9rifier les inter=
faces et les =C3=A9tats des connexions.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"3093" data-end=3D"3096" class=3D"">
<h3 data-start=3D"3098" data-end=3D"3141" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3102" data-end=3D"3141">2.2. Plan de Diagnostic en 5 =C3=89tapes</strong></=
h3>
<p data-start=3D"3143" data-end=3D"3271" class=3D"">Lors du d=C3=A9pannage =
en temps r=C3=A9el, il est utile de suivre une m=C3=A9thode de diagnostic e=
n 5 =C3=A9tapes, adapt=C3=A9e aux sc=C3=A9narios complexes :</p>
<ol data-start=3D"3273" data-end=3D"4385">
<li data-start=3D"3273" data-end=3D"3480" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3276" data-end=3D"3300" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
276" data-end=3D"3300">Isoler le probl=C3=A8me :</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"3304" data-end=3D"3480">
<li data-start=3D"3304" data-end=3D"3476" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3306" data-end=3D"3476" class=3D"">Commencez par identifie=
r les sympt=C3=B4mes et les impacts. Utilisez des outils comme <strong data=
-start=3D"3387" data-end=3D"3395">ping</strong>, <strong data-start=3D"3397=
" data-end=3D"3411">traceroute</strong>, ou <strong data-start=3D"3416" dat=
a-end=3D"3433">show commands</strong> pour d=C3=A9terminer o=C3=B9 le probl=
=C3=A8me se produit.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3481" data-end=3D"3685" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3484" data-end=3D"3517" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
484" data-end=3D"3517">V=C3=A9rifier les configurations :</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"3521" data-end=3D"3685">
<li data-start=3D"3521" data-end=3D"3681" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3523" data-end=3D"3681" class=3D"">Assurez-vous que la con=
figuration du r=C3=A9seau est correcte. Cela inclut les configurations de <=
strong data-start=3D"3615" data-end=3D"3626">routage</strong>, <strong data=
-start=3D"3628" data-end=3D"3643">commutation</strong>, <strong data-start=
=3D"3645" data-end=3D"3657">firewall</strong>, <strong data-start=3D"3659" =
data-end=3D"3666">VPN</strong>, <strong data-start=3D"3668" data-end=3D"367=
5">QoS</strong>, etc.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3686" data-end=3D"3927" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3689" data-end=3D"3718" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
689" data-end=3D"3718">Analyser les protocoles :</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"3722" data-end=3D"3927">
<li data-start=3D"3722" data-end=3D"3923" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3724" data-end=3D"3923" class=3D"">Utilisez des outils com=
me <strong data-start=3D"3750" data-end=3D"3759">debug</strong>, <strong da=
ta-start=3D"3761" data-end=3D"3782">show ip protocols</strong>, <strong dat=
a-start=3D"3784" data-end=3D"3803">show interfaces</strong>, et des command=
es sp=C3=A9cifiques aux protocoles pour analyser le trafic et identifier le=
s anomalies dans la communication.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3928" data-end=3D"4160" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3931" data-end=3D"3975" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
931" data-end=3D"3975">Diagnostiquer la performance du r=C3=A9seau :</stron=
g></p>
<ul data-start=3D"3979" data-end=3D"4160">
<li data-start=3D"3979" data-end=3D"4156" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3981" data-end=3D"4156" class=3D"">Examinez les performanc=
es du r=C3=A9seau via des outils comme <strong data-start=3D"4038" data-end=
=3D"4049">NetFlow</strong>, <strong data-start=3D"4051" data-end=3D"4064">W=
ireshark</strong>, et <strong data-start=3D"4069" data-end=3D"4077">SNMP</s=
trong> pour d=C3=A9tecter les probl=C3=A8mes de congestion, de latence, ou =
de perte de paquets.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4161" data-end=3D"4385" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4164" data-end=3D"4192" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
164" data-end=3D"4192">Appliquer une solution :</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"4196" data-end=3D"4385">
<li data-start=3D"4196" data-end=3D"4385" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4198" data-end=3D"4385" class=3D"">Apr=C3=A8s avoir identi=
fi=C3=A9 le probl=C3=A8me, appliquez une solution. Cela peut aller de la co=
rrection de la configuration =C3=A0 la mise =C3=A0 jour du firmware, ou enc=
ore la r=C3=A9initialisation des interfaces.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"4387" data-end=3D"4390" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"4392" data-end=3D"4448" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4395" data-end=3D"4448">3. Sc=C3=A9narios de D=C3=A9pannage Complexes en Te=
mps R=C3=A9el</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"4450" data-end=3D"4501" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4454" data-end=3D"4501">3.1. Probl=C3=A8me de Routage (OSPF, EIGRP, BGP)</s=
trong></h3>
<h4 data-start=3D"4503" data-end=3D"4577" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4508" data-end=3D"4577">Sc=C3=A9nario : Probl=C3=A8me de Routage OSPF dans =
un R=C3=A9seau Multi-Routeurs</strong></h4>
<ul data-start=3D"4579" data-end=3D"5523">
<li data-start=3D"4579" data-end=3D"4743" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4581" data-end=3D"4743" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
581" data-end=3D"4596">Sympt=C3=B4mes :</strong> Des paquets ne sont pas ac=
hemin=C3=A9s correctement entre les diff=C3=A9rents segments de r=C3=A9seau=
. Certains sites distants ne peuvent pas acc=C3=A9der =C3=A0 Internet.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4747" data-end=3D"5523" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4749" data-end=3D"4774" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
749" data-end=3D"4774">=C3=89tapes de d=C3=A9pannage :</strong></p>
<ol data-start=3D"4780" data-end=3D"5523">
<li data-start=3D"4780" data-end=3D"4851" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4783" data-end=3D"4851" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
783" data-end=3D"4851">V=C3=A9rifiez les tables de routage avec la commande=
 <code data-start=3D"4833" data-end=3D"4848">show ip route</code>.</strong>=
</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4854" data-end=3D"5008" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4857" data-end=3D"5008" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
857" data-end=3D"4919">V=C3=A9rifiez les interfaces OSPF avec <code data-st=
art=3D"4893" data-end=3D"4916">show ip ospf neighbor</code>.</strong> Assur=
ez-vous que les voisins OSPF sont =C3=A9tablis et que l'=C3=A9tat de la con=
nexion est "Full".</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5011" data-end=3D"5156" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5014" data-end=3D"5156" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
014" data-end=3D"5156">Utilisez la commande <code data-start=3D"5037" data-=
end=3D"5061">show ip ospf interface</code> pour examiner les interfaces OSP=
F et v=C3=A9rifier les m=C3=A9triques, les timers et la configuration.</str=
ong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5159" data-end=3D"5252" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5162" data-end=3D"5252" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
162" data-end=3D"5252">Examinez les logs avec <code data-start=3D"5187" dat=
a-end=3D"5209">debug ip ospf events</code> pour toute anomalie ou message d=
'erreur.</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5255" data-end=3D"5354" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5258" data-end=3D"5354" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
258" data-end=3D"5354">Assurez-vous que le domaine OSPF est coh=C3=A9rent e=
t que les r=C3=A9seaux sont correctement annonc=C3=A9s.</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5357" data-end=3D"5441" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5360" data-end=3D"5441" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
360" data-end=3D"5441">Corrigez toute configuration erron=C3=A9e ou non ali=
gn=C3=A9e avec la topologie pr=C3=A9vue.</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5444" data-end=3D"5523" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5447" data-end=3D"5523" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
447" data-end=3D"5523">Red=C3=A9marrez le processus OSPF si n=C3=A9cessaire=
 avec <code data-start=3D"5497" data-end=3D"5520">clear ip ospf process</co=
de>.</strong></p>
</li>
</ol>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 data-start=3D"5525" data-end=3D"5592" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5530" data-end=3D"5592">Sc=C3=A9nario : Probl=C3=A8me de Routage BGP avec F=
iltrage Incorrect</strong></h4>
<ul data-start=3D"5594" data-end=3D"6357">
<li data-start=3D"5594" data-end=3D"5737" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5596" data-end=3D"5737" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
596" data-end=3D"5611">Sympt=C3=B4mes :</strong> Certaines routes ne sont p=
as propag=C3=A9es entre les ASN (autonomous system number). Des routes BGP =
attendues ne sont pas re=C3=A7ues.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5739" data-end=3D"6357" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5741" data-end=3D"5766" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
741" data-end=3D"5766">=C3=89tapes de d=C3=A9pannage :</strong></p>
<ol data-start=3D"5772" data-end=3D"6357">
<li data-start=3D"5772" data-end=3D"5865" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5775" data-end=3D"5865" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
775" data-end=3D"5865">Examinez la table de routage BGP avec <code data-sta=
rt=3D"5815" data-end=3D"5828">show ip bgp</code> et v=C3=A9rifiez les route=
s manquantes.</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5868" data-end=3D"5988" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5871" data-end=3D"5988" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
871" data-end=3D"5988">V=C3=A9rifiez les politiques de filtrage avec <code =
data-start=3D"5914" data-end=3D"5934">show ip bgp regexp</code> pour recher=
cher des filtres de pr=C3=A9fixes incorrects.</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5991" data-end=3D"6126" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5994" data-end=3D"6126" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
994" data-end=3D"6126">Utilisez <code data-start=3D"6005" data-end=3D"6019"=
>debug ip bgp</code> pour observer les mises =C3=A0 jour BGP en temps r=C3=
=A9el et d=C3=A9tecter toute anomalie dans les =C3=A9changes de routes.</st=
rong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6129" data-end=3D"6205" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6132" data-end=3D"6205" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
132" data-end=3D"6205">V=C3=A9rifiez les ACL et les route maps appliqu=C3=
=A9es sur les interfaces BGP.</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6208" data-end=3D"6357" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6211" data-end=3D"6357" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
211" data-end=3D"6357">V=C3=A9rifiez la configuration du med, de la priorit=
=C3=A9 et des attributs de route pour vous assurer qu'ils n'affectent pas l=
a propagation des routes.</strong></p>
</li>
</ol>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"6359" data-end=3D"6362" class=3D"">
<h3 data-start=3D"6364" data-end=3D"6408" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
6368" data-end=3D"6408">3.2. Probl=C3=A8me de VLAN et Commutation</strong><=
/h3>
<h4 data-start=3D"6410" data-end=3D"6471" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
6415" data-end=3D"6471">Sc=C3=A9nario : Probl=C3=A8me de Trunking et d=E2=
=80=99Acc=C3=A8s aux VLANs</strong></h4>
<ul data-start=3D"6473" data-end=3D"7364">
<li data-start=3D"6473" data-end=3D"6621" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6475" data-end=3D"6621" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
475" data-end=3D"6490">Sympt=C3=B4mes :</strong> Les p=C3=A9riph=C3=A9rique=
s d'un VLAN ne peuvent pas communiquer entre eux, mais les p=C3=A9riph=C3=
=A9riques d'autres VLANs fonctionnent correctement.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6623" data-end=3D"7364" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6625" data-end=3D"6650" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
625" data-end=3D"6650">=C3=89tapes de d=C3=A9pannage :</strong></p>
<ol data-start=3D"6656" data-end=3D"7364">
<li data-start=3D"6656" data-end=3D"6797" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6659" data-end=3D"6797" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
659" data-end=3D"6727">V=C3=A9rifiez la configuration du trunk avec <code d=
ata-start=3D"6701" data-end=3D"6724">show interfaces trunk</code>.</strong>=
 Assurez-vous que les VLANs attendus sont bien autoris=C3=A9s sur le trunk.=
</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6800" data-end=3D"6918" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6803" data-end=3D"6918" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
803" data-end=3D"6918">Utilisez <code data-start=3D"6814" data-end=3D"6831"=
>show vlan brief</code> pour v=C3=A9rifier que les VLANs sont actifs et que=
 les ports sont correctement assign=C3=A9s.</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6921" data-end=3D"7084" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6924" data-end=3D"7084" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
924" data-end=3D"7084">V=C3=A9rifiez la configuration de <strong data-start=
=3D"6955" data-end=3D"6978">Spanning Tree (STP)</strong> avec <code data-st=
art=3D"6984" data-end=3D"7019">show spanning-tree vlan &lt;vlan_id&gt;</cod=
e> pour v=C3=A9rifier qu'il n'y a pas de boucle ou de blocage de port.</str=
ong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7087" data-end=3D"7235" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7090" data-end=3D"7235" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
090" data-end=3D"7235">Assurez-vous que les configurations des ports d'acc=
