PF, EIGRP, BGP), des <strong data-start=3D"661" data-end=3D"687">protocoles=
 de s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9</strong> (ACLs, VPNs, 802.1X), ainsi que des <strong=
 data-start=3D"724" data-end=3D"753">protocoles de commutation</strong> (Sp=
anning Tree Protocol, VLANs, EtherChannel).</p>
<hr data-start=3D"802" data-end=3D"805" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"807" data-end=3D"852" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"81=
0" data-end=3D"852">1. D=C3=A9pannage des Protocoles de Routage</strong></h=
2>
<p data-start=3D"854" data-end=3D"1120" class=3D"">Les protocoles de routag=
e permettent de d=C3=A9terminer le meilleur chemin pour transmettre les don=
n=C3=A9es d'un r=C3=A9seau =C3=A0 un autre. Une d=C3=A9faillance dans ces p=
rotocoles peut entra=C3=AEner des coupures de service, des pertes de connec=
tivit=C3=A9 ou des comportements de routage erron=C3=A9s.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"1122" data-end=3D"1181" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
1126" data-end=3D"1181">1.1. D=C3=A9pannage de l=E2=80=99OSPF (Open Shortes=
t Path First)</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"1183" data-end=3D"1200" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
183" data-end=3D"1198">Sympt=C3=B4mes :</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"1201" data-end=3D"1323">
<li data-start=3D"1201" data-end=3D"1226" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1203" data-end=3D"1226" class=3D"">Absence de voisins OSPF=
</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1227" data-end=3D"1276" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1229" data-end=3D"1276" class=3D"">Routes OSPF manquantes =
dans la table de routage</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1277" data-end=3D"1323" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1279" data-end=3D"1323" class=3D"">Probl=C3=A8mes de conve=
rgence lents ou incorrects</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 data-start=3D"1325" data-end=3D"1355" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
1330" data-end=3D"1355">=C3=89tapes de d=C3=A9pannage :</strong></h4>
<ol data-start=3D"1357" data-end=3D"2612">
<li data-start=3D"1357" data-end=3D"1711" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1360" data-end=3D"1413" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
360" data-end=3D"1413">V=C3=A9rification des interfaces et des voisins OSPF=
 :</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"1417" data-end=3D"1711">
<li data-start=3D"1417" data-end=3D"1453" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1419" data-end=3D"1453" class=3D"">Commande : <code data-s=
tart=3D"1430" data-end=3D"1453">show ip ospf neighbor</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1457" data-end=3D"1554" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1459" data-end=3D"1554" class=3D"">Cela permet de v=C3=A9r=
ifier l'=C3=A9tat des voisins OSPF et d=E2=80=99identifier les probl=C3=A8m=
es de communication.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1558" data-end=3D"1707" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1560" data-end=3D"1707" class=3D"">Si les voisins OSPF ne =
sont pas =C3=A9tablis, v=C3=A9rifier que les interfaces sont dans le m=C3=
=AAme r=C3=A9seau et que les adresses IP sont configur=C3=A9es correctement=
.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1712" data-end=3D"1967" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1715" data-end=3D"1776" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
715" data-end=3D"1776">V=C3=A9rification des interfaces OSPF et de la confi=
guration :</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"1780" data-end=3D"1967">
<li data-start=3D"1780" data-end=3D"1817" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1782" data-end=3D"1817" class=3D"">Commande : <code data-s=
tart=3D"1793" data-end=3D"1817">show ip ospf interface</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1821" data-end=3D"1967" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1823" data-end=3D"1967" class=3D"">Cette commande permet d=
e v=C3=A9rifier les configurations des interfaces (par exemple, les co=C3=
=BBts de l=E2=80=99interface, les d=C3=A9lais, les interfaces de zone).</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1969" data-end=3D"2230" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1972" data-end=3D"2006" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
972" data-end=3D"2006">V=C3=A9rification des routes OSPF :</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"2010" data-end=3D"2230">
<li data-start=3D"2010" data-end=3D"2043" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2012" data-end=3D"2043" class=3D"">Commande : <code data-s=
tart=3D"2023" data-end=3D"2043">show ip route ospf</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2047" data-end=3D"2230" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2049" data-end=3D"2230" class=3D"">Cette commande montre l=
es routes OSPF dans la table de routage. Si des routes sont absentes, il pe=
ut =C3=AAtre n=C3=A9cessaire de v=C3=A9rifier les liens ou les configuratio=
ns de routeurs voisins.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2232" data-end=3D"2420" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2235" data-end=3D"2268" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
235" data-end=3D"2268">V=C3=A9rification des zones OSPF :</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"2272" data-end=3D"2420">
<li data-start=3D"2272" data-end=3D"2308" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2274" data-end=3D"2308" class=3D"">Commande : <code data-s=
tart=3D"2285" data-end=3D"2308">show ip ospf database</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2312" data-end=3D"2420" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2314" data-end=3D"2420" class=3D"">Permet de v=C3=A9rifier=
 l'=C3=A9tat de la base de donn=C3=A9es OSPF pour s'assurer qu'elle est cor=
rectement synchronis=C3=A9e.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2422" data-end=3D"2612" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2425" data-end=3D"2466" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
425" data-end=3D"2466">V=C3=A9rification des r=C3=A8gles de filtrage :</str=
ong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"2470" data-end=3D"2612">
<li data-start=3D"2470" data-end=3D"2505" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2472" data-end=3D"2505" class=3D"">Commande : <code data-s=
tart=3D"2483" data-end=3D"2505">show ip ospf filters</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2509" data-end=3D"2612" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2511" data-end=3D"2612" class=3D"">Cela permet de s'assure=
r qu'il n'y a pas de filtres de routage OSPF qui bloquent l'=C3=A9change de=
 routes.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start=3D"2614" data-end=3D"2692" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
2618" data-end=3D"2692">1.2. D=C3=A9pannage de l=E2=80=99EIGRP (Enhanced In=
terior Gateway Routing Protocol)</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"2694" data-end=3D"2711" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
694" data-end=3D"2709">Sympt=C3=B4mes :</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"2712" data-end=3D"2829">
<li data-start=3D"2712" data-end=3D"2738" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2714" data-end=3D"2738" class=3D"">Absence de voisins EIGR=
P</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2739" data-end=3D"2802" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2741" data-end=3D"2802" class=3D"">Routes EIGRP manquantes=
 ou instables dans la table de routage</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2803" data-end=3D"2829" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2805" data-end=3D"2829" class=3D"">Anomalies de convergenc=
e</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 data-start=3D"2831" data-end=3D"2861" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
2836" data-end=3D"2861">=C3=89tapes de d=C3=A9pannage :</strong></h4>
<ol data-start=3D"2863" data-end=3D"3815">
<li data-start=3D"2863" data-end=3D"3119" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2866" data-end=3D"2902" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
866" data-end=3D"2902">V=C3=A9rification des voisins EIGRP :</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"2906" data-end=3D"3119">
<li data-start=3D"2906" data-end=3D"2944" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2908" data-end=3D"2944" class=3D"">Commande : <code data-s=
tart=3D"2919" data-end=3D"2944">show ip eigrp neighbors</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2948" data-end=3D"3115" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2950" data-end=3D"3115" class=3D"">Cette commande montre l=
es voisins EIGRP =C3=A9tablis. Si aucun voisin n'est trouv=C3=A9, v=C3=A9ri=
fier les adresses IP, le AS (Autonomous System) et la connectivit=C3=A9 des=
 interfaces.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3120" data-end=3D"3397" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3123" data-end=3D"3170" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
123" data-end=3D"3170">V=C3=A9rification des interfaces et des routes :</st=
rong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"3174" data-end=3D"3397">
<li data-start=3D"3174" data-end=3D"3212" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3176" data-end=3D"3212" class=3D"">Commande : <code data-s=
tart=3D"3187" data-end=3D"3212">show ip eigrp interface</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3216" data-end=3D"3253" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3218" data-end=3D"3253" class=3D"">Commande : <code data-s=
tart=3D"3229" data-end=3D"3253">show ip eigrp topology</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3257" data-end=3D"3397" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3259" data-end=3D"3397" class=3D"">Assurez-vous que les in=
terfaces sont correctement configur=C3=A9es pour EIGRP et que la table de t=
opologie contient des informations correctes.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3399" data-end=3D"3589" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3402" data-end=3D"3434" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
402" data-end=3D"3434">V=C3=A9rification des m=C3=A9triques :</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"3438" data-end=3D"3589">
<li data-start=3D"3438" data-end=3D"3472" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3440" data-end=3D"3472" class=3D"">Commande : <code data-s=
tart=3D"3451" data-end=3D"3472">show ip route eigrp</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3476" data-end=3D"3589" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3478" data-end=3D"3589" class=3D"">V=C3=A9rifiez les m=C3=
=A9triques des routes pour s'assurer qu'elles sont correctes et que la meil=
leure route est choisie.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3591" data-end=3D"3815" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3594" data-end=3D"3629" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
594" data-end=3D"3629">V=C3=A9rification des timers EIGRP :</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"3633" data-end=3D"3815">
<li data-start=3D"3633" data-end=3D"3671" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3635" data-end=3D"3671" class=3D"">Commande : <code data-s=
tart=3D"3646" data-end=3D"3671">show ip eigrp neighbors</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3675" data-end=3D"3815" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3677" data-end=3D"3815" class=3D"">V=C3=A9rifiez les timer=
s de Hello et Hold. Des param=C3=A8tres incorrects peuvent emp=C3=AAcher la=
 formation des voisins ou causer une convergence lente.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start=3D"3817" data-end=3D"3872" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3821" data-end=3D"3872">1.3. D=C3=A9pannage du BGP (Border Gateway Protocol=
)</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"3874" data-end=3D"3891" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
874" data-end=3D"3889">Sympt=C3=B4mes :</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"3892" data-end=3D"3991">
<li data-start=3D"3892" data-end=3D"3916" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3894" data-end=3D"3916" class=3D"">Absence de voisins BGP<=
/p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3917" data-end=3D"3960" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3919" data-end=3D"3960" class=3D"">Routes BGP non propag=
=C3=A9es ou non accept=C3=A9es</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3961" data-end=3D"3991" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3963" data-end=3D"3991" class=3D"">Probl=C3=A8mes de conve=
rgence BGP</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 data-start=3D"3993" data-end=3D"4023" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3998" data-end=3D"4023">=C3=89tapes de d=C3=A9pannage :</strong></h4>
<ol data-start=3D"4025" data-end=3D"4744">
<li data-start=3D"4025" data-end=3D"4200" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4028" data-end=3D"4062" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
028" data-end=3D"4062">V=C3=A9rification des voisins BGP :</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"4066" data-end=3D"4200">
<li data-start=3D"4066" data-end=3D"4100" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4068" data-end=3D"4100" class=3D"">Commande : <code data-s=
tart=3D"4079" data-end=3D"4100">show ip bgp summary</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4104" data-end=3D"4200" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4106" data-end=3D"4200" class=3D"">Cela permet de v=C3=A9r=
ifier l'=C3=A9tat des voisins BGP et de d=C3=A9terminer si la session BGP e=
st =C3=A9tablie.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4202" data-end=3D"4381" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4205" data-end=3D"4238" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
205" data-end=3D"4238">V=C3=A9rification des routes BGP :</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"4242" data-end=3D"4381">
<li data-start=3D"4242" data-end=3D"4268" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4244" data-end=3D"4268" class=3D"">Commande : <code data-s=
tart=3D"4255" data-end=3D"4268">show ip bgp</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4272" data-end=3D"4381" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4274" data-end=3D"4381" class=3D"">Affiche les routes appr=
ises via BGP et leur =C3=A9tat. V=C3=A9rifiez les routes disponibles et les=
 pr=C3=A9fixes annonc=C3=A9s.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4383" data-end=3D"4548" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4386" data-end=3D"4420" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
386" data-end=3D"4420">V=C3=A9rification des filtres BGP :</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"4424" data-end=3D"4548">
<li data-start=3D"4424" data-end=3D"4458" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4426" data-end=3D"4458" class=3D"">Commande : <code data-s=
tart=3D"4437" data-end=3D"4458">show ip bgp filters</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4462" data-end=3D"4548" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4464" data-end=3D"4548" class=3D"">V=C3=A9rifiez s'il y a =
des r=C3=A8gles qui filtrent l'annonce ou l'acceptation des routes BGP.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4550" data-end=3D"4744" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4553" data-end=3D"4611" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
553" data-end=3D"4611">V=C3=A9rification des chemins AS (Autonomous System =
Path) :</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"4615" data-end=3D"4744">
<li data-start=3D"4615" data-end=3D"4646" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4617" data-end=3D"4646" class=3D"">Commande : <code data-s=
tart=3D"4628" data-end=3D"4646">show ip bgp path</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4650" data-end=3D"4744" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4652" data-end=3D"4744" class=3D"">Permet de v=C3=A9rifier=
 les chemins AS et s'assurer que les annonces sont propag=C3=A9es correctem=
ent.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"4746" data-end=3D"4749" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"4751" data-end=3D"4797" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4754" data-end=3D"4797">2. D=C3=A9pannage des Protocoles de S=C3=A9curit=C3=
=A9</strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"4799" data-end=3D"5018" class=3D"">Les protocoles de s=C3=
=A9curit=C3=A9 assurent la confidentialit=C3=A9, l'int=C3=A9grit=C3=A9 et l=
'authentification des donn=C3=A9es circulant dans le r=C3=A9seau. Un probl=
=C3=A8me dans ces protocoles peut entra=C3=AEner une vuln=C3=A9rabilit=C3=
=A9 importante pour le r=C3=A9seau.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"5020" data-end=3D"5074" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5024" data-end=3D"5074">2.1. D=C3=A9pannage des ACLs (Access Control Lists)=
</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"5076" data-end=3D"5093" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
076" data-end=3D"5091">Sympt=C3=B4mes :</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"5094" data-end=3D"5189">
<li data-start=3D"5094" data-end=3D"5135" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5096" data-end=3D"5135" class=3D"">Probl=C3=A8mes d'acc=C3=
=A8s aux ressources r=C3=A9seau</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5136" data-end=3D"5189" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5138" data-end=3D"5189" class=3D"">Perte de connectivit=C3=
=A9 entre certains h=C3=B4tes ou VLANs</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 data-start=3D"5191" data-end=3D"5221" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5196" data-end=3D"5221">=C3=89tapes de d=C3=A9pannage :</strong></h4>
<ol data-start=3D"5223" data-end=3D"5967">
<li data-start=3D"5223" data-end=3D"5446" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5226" data-end=3D"5287" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
226" data-end=3D"5287">V=C3=A9rification de la syntaxe et de l=E2=80=99appl=
ication des ACLs :</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"5291" data-end=3D"5446">
<li data-start=3D"5291" data-end=3D"5323" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5293" data-end=3D"5323" class=3D"">Commande : <code data-s=
tart=3D"5304" data-end=3D"5323">show access-lists</code></p>
</li>
