807" data-end=3D"7822">Sympt=C3=B4mes :</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"7825" data-end=3D"7906">
<li data-start=3D"7825" data-end=3D"7841" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7827" data-end=3D"7841" class=3D"">Boucles r=C3=A9seau</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7842" data-end=3D"7878" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7844" data-end=3D"7878" class=3D"">Probl=C3=A8mes de conve=
rgence STP lents</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7879" data-end=3D"7906" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7881" data-end=3D"7906" class=3D"">Ports bloqu=C3=A9s ou i=
nactifs</p>
</li>
</ul>
