7913" data-end=3D"7938">=C3=89tapes de d=C3=A9pannage :</strong></h4>
<ol data-start=3D"7940" data-end=3D"8534">
<li data-start=3D"7940" data-end=3D"8114" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7943" data-end=3D"7978" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
943" data-end=3D"7978">V=C3=A9rification de l'=C3=A9tat de STP :</strong></=
p>
