<p data-start=3D"8021" data-end=3D"8114" class=3D"">V=C3=A9rifiez l'=C3=A9t=
at des ports (Racine, Design=C3=A9, Bloqu=C3=A9) et assurez-vous que le r=
=C3=A9seau est stable.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8116" data-end=3D"8321" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8119" data-end=3D"8157" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"8=
